{"1388870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcade Paradise", "steam_appid": 1388870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2217400, 2217403, 2217402, 2217401, 1986512, 1986510, 1986511, 2021100, 2146200, 2217404, 2303250], "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST MEOW! 😻</h1><p></p><br><h1>BUY ARCADE PARADISE VR NOW!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Arcade Paradise, the 90’s-fuelled retro arcade adventure. Rather than washing rags for a living, you decide to turn the family laundromat into the ultimate arcade. Play, profit, and purchase new arcade machines, with over 35 to choose from, to build your very own Arcade Paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/43b9edeae07884e7b038f6abcf841a2c.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/43b9edeae07884e7b038f6abcf841a2c.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/43b9edeae07884e7b038f6abcf841a2c.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the laundromat business made up of dull chores from washing clothes to throwing out the trash, and turn it into a booming arcade with the coolest games in town raking in all the money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd451eb67dd2aad8d40d3c6f9549100a.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd451eb67dd2aad8d40d3c6f9549100a.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/fd451eb67dd2aad8d40d3c6f9549100a.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/f78055df794dfdd4b0d91836eebce2d1.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/f78055df794dfdd4b0d91836eebce2d1.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/f78055df794dfdd4b0d91836eebce2d1.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 35 arcade games, each fully realized with its own gameplay, stories, missions, and high scores to set! Inspired by 3 decades of gaming, from early vector games right up to the 32-bit era. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/036eab1923533824019452e4a28a931a.poster.avif?t=1782220777\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/036eab1923533824019452e4a28a931a.webm?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388870/extras/036eab1923533824019452e4a28a931a.mp4?t=1782220777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl